Subject: [PATCH 03/23] rusticc: hx711s / hx717s load cell (COSMOS 0007), CC1
 bed dictionary

- extras/load_cell/hx711s.rs: up to 4 HX711/HX717 chips as one load cell
  (the CC1 bed's [load_cell_probe] sensor_type: hx711s)
- ref_setup.sh builds the CC1 bed MCU dictionary from COSMOS's config.bed
  (/ci_build/dict/cc1_bed.dict)
- rusticc/cases: hx711s (the CC1's config, a one-chip hx717s) and its config
  errors; the FORCE_SHAPER errors as their own failing cases

Verified: 10/10 rusticc cases identical to the COSMOS reference, full set
159/160 (printers/13 timing as before); unit test of the sample decoding
against COSMOS's python.

